{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le07ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Hi V, I'm so glad Candice got you to do this with me!\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Me too. It feels great to lend a helping hand.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: It sure does. I've already spoken with a few of the underprivileged folks that we will be serving. For the most part they're wonderful people who have fallen on hard times.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll be honest, though, I'm a bit nervous. I don't think I can do this alone.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: You don't have to do it alone. It says right here in your volunteering handbook: \u201cNew volunteers shall be accompanied by a senior volunteer at all times.\u201d", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Oh no! That little leaflet? I thought it was junk mail, so I threw it out! I really should have read it. What else did it say?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well, it says that \u201call volunteers shall complete a background check\u201d and \u201cvolunteers shall not bring personal belongings into the kitchen.\u201d\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Phew. I got my police check sent directly to them, so that's taken care of. And I'll get a senior volunteer to store my purse in one of the lockers.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Great, well let's get started then!\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: What should we do first?", "time": "31500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn10le07ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Well these plates are all dirty. They clearly should have been cleaned by the first shift of helpers. I think we ought to wash them.\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Absolutely, and we probably ought to scrub the countertops, right?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Good thinking. Why don't you start with that while I get the team leader to make a list of duties for us?\n<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sounds like a plan. I'm so glad you're here, Amy. I feel better about this already!", "time": "64500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about social issues and moral dilemmas.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about getting something done. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can express what is necessary.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " In your local community, where can those in need go to get food?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think it is helpful to give money to the homeless? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "  What's going on at the soup kitchen?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_d